MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 REM the frame interrupt's polar objects use the multiplier: a program's * and DIV must still be right
>15 OBJUPDATE ON:FOR I%=0 TO 200:OBJECT I%,0,0,0:OBJMOVE I%,1,I%,1,0.01:NEXT
>20 E%=0:FOR I%=1 TO 20000:A%=I%*7919:IF A% DIV 7919<>I% THEN E%=E%+1
>30 IF I% MOD 4000=0 THEN B=I%*1.5:IF B<>I%+I%/2 THEN E%=E%+1
>40 NEXT:PRINT "errors ";E%
>RUN
errors 0
>
